WEBVTT

00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:03.761
Catia: Impossible.

00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:06.847
These are the exploits of a
secret agency of professionals,

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:09.600
who use the extent of their
wits and strength to execute orders

00:00:09.683 --> 00:00:12.061
that are impossible to carry out.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.403
Mitaiken na no

00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:27.159
Me no mae ni kotae wa iroiro aru kedo

00:00:27.243 --> 00:00:34.375
Hitotsu no oozora wo nan toubun dekiru?

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:36.252
Tanoshii kara subete wo kudasai

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:38.003
atashi tteba dokusen shitai

00:00:38.087 --> 00:00:41.465
Honne ga koboreru yo Blue sky

00:00:41.549 --> 00:00:49.181
Mou! Namae wo kaite okou kienai you ni

00:00:49.265 --> 00:00:50.975
Shinken ni nattara?

00:00:51.058 --> 00:00:56.230
Sou you no yada nante iwasenai

00:00:56.313 --> 00:01:02.987
Jun'ai souchi (Set up now) ugokidase

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:07.032
Aseri to yume no kassouro

00:01:07.116 --> 00:01:10.911
Shiitoberuto wa motto gyutto itashite

00:01:10.995 --> 00:01:17.793
Saishinsouchi (Back up now) ugokidasu

00:01:17.876 --> 00:01:21.839
Anata no kokoro dake wa

00:01:21.922 --> 00:01:25.551
orijinaru ga hoshikute

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:29.555
sakusen tatemashita yo

00:01:34.018 --> 00:01:37.771
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:02:03.631 --> 00:02:06.675
Ah, Kio! Good morning!

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.345
This isn't right, Eris! It's not right!

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:14.433
I'm sorry. I'm kind of in the
mating season mood right now.

00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:17.311
Geez, what am I going to do with you?

00:02:17.394 --> 00:02:20.356
Where do you suppose we are?

00:02:20.439 --> 00:02:23.067
It looks rather plushly appointed, huh?

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:25.277
Is it to your liking, then?

00:02:26.236 --> 00:02:28.489
Um, where are we?

00:02:28.572 --> 00:02:30.366
You are in the private
room of the Divine Embodiment,

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:32.701
aboard the Androala,
headquarters of the kitty-ear order,

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.870
Underside of the Kitten's Paw.

00:02:34.953 --> 00:02:39.249
Divine Embodiment? And what
exactly is this Divine Embodiment?

00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:42.378
Why, Miss Eris, that is you.

00:02:46.256 --> 00:02:48.717
"--30km from Tokyo Bay--"

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.678
| can't let you do this.

00:02:50.761 --> 00:02:53.555
It is against my service regulations
for me to pose as a deity,

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:55.808
and be given any special attention

00:02:55.891 --> 00:02:58.185
by any particular religious order.

00:02:58.268 --> 00:03:03.857
We have long prayed that a
being with genuine kitty-ears and a tail

00:03:03.941 --> 00:03:05.526
would manifest itself to us in our world.

00:03:05.609 --> 00:03:08.946
And so, just as our lady-- or
rather, our Founder-- has spoken,

00:03:09.029 --> 00:03:11.031
you have appeared.

00:03:11.115 --> 00:03:14.118
You are, without a doubt,
the very Divine Embodiment.

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:17.371
Well then, as the Divine Embodiment,
| give you an order.

00:03:17.454 --> 00:03:19.790
Please release me from this place at once.

00:03:19.873 --> 00:03:23.210
| cannot do that.
Such is the desire of the Founder.

00:03:23.293 --> 00:03:24.670
Well, that's kind of...

00:03:24.753 --> 00:03:26.714
Instead, if I may...

00:03:33.804 --> 00:03:35.222
How do you like this?

00:03:35.305 --> 00:03:36.473
--Gulp!
--Gulp!

00:03:36.557 --> 00:03:39.935
W-What do you say we
stay here for a little longer, Kio?

00:03:40.018 --> 00:03:41.603
Y-Yeah!

00:03:45.023 --> 00:03:47.151
The Divine Embodiment has awakened.

00:03:47.234 --> 00:03:49.778
Mm-hmm, treat her with the utmost courtesy.

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.572
As you wish.

00:03:51.655 --> 00:03:54.616
What do you think, Maya?
It turned out as a perfect replica.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.326
With this, no matter how close I may get,

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.163
it will not raise the
Divine Embodiment's suspicion.

00:03:59.246 --> 00:04:01.206
Outstanding, my lady.

00:04:01.957 --> 00:04:05.085
The kitty-ear order,
Underside of the Kitten's Paw?

00:04:05.169 --> 00:04:08.714
| knew there were religions that
worshipped cats in ancient Egypt,

00:04:08.797 --> 00:04:11.300
but for them to worship ears and tails...

00:04:11.383 --> 00:04:12.801
Contact Yokota.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:15.220
Have them make ready the
equipment package Peanut Vendor.

00:04:15.304 --> 00:04:16.180
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:16.263 --> 00:04:18.932
We'll take out the cats,
along with the fools that follow the cats,

00:04:19.016 --> 00:04:21.018
together in one fell swoop.

00:04:24.396 --> 00:04:27.357
No! No! The PBR is one thing,

00:04:27.441 --> 00:04:30.194
but a powerboat is out of the question.

00:04:30.277 --> 00:04:34.198
We can't take a boat that has
no speed. It has to be a powerboat,

00:04:34.281 --> 00:04:37.451
and one that has been
greatly souped-up, at that.

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:41.288
I'm a weapons dealer.
A powerboat is not a weapon.

00:04:41.371 --> 00:04:43.248
Oh, but I heard that you'd just gotten in

00:04:43.332 --> 00:04:47.586
a fully tuned converted
powerboat used by the Miami Police.

00:04:47.669 --> 00:04:51.548
Word gets around as quick as ever,
| see. But it's already booked.

00:04:52.341 --> 00:04:53.258
Booked?

00:04:53.342 --> 00:04:56.887
If you absolutely must have it,
deal directly with him.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.931
There, he just walked in.

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:03.101
What are you two doing here?

00:05:03.185 --> 00:05:04.728
Uncle Yuichi!

00:05:04.812 --> 00:05:07.064
You don't mean, you have the powerboat?

00:05:07.147 --> 00:05:11.276
Oh, that? A movie director friend
of mine said he needed to use one,

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.861
and I acted as the go-between.

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:14.822
Wow, look at that equipment!

00:05:14.905 --> 00:05:18.367
Cool, aren't they?
They're just props for the shoot, though.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.953
Where is it right now?

00:05:21.036 --> 00:05:24.581
Chichijima. The shooting
location will be Ogasawara.

00:05:28.836 --> 00:05:33.173
Mm, I'm so full! I'm so content!

00:05:34.883 --> 00:05:38.345
Amazing! You only eat
the skin on a Peking Duck, huh?

00:05:38.428 --> 00:05:39.680
All right then,

00:05:39.763 --> 00:05:43.851
now that we're full, I think it's time we left.

00:05:43.934 --> 00:05:46.103
Leave? But how?

00:05:46.186 --> 00:05:49.189
This outfit is a scaled-down powersuit,

00:05:49.273 --> 00:05:51.984
so I can break through
a bulkhead like this one.

00:05:52.067 --> 00:05:55.445
Let's call the Assistroids,
and make our escape.

00:05:55.529 --> 00:05:57.781
Okay then, here goes...

00:06:00.868 --> 00:06:02.744
Ee-yow!

00:06:02.828 --> 00:06:06.123
It hurts! It hurts, Kio!

00:06:06.206 --> 00:06:07.916
Are you okay, Eris?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.544
What could have happened? Ordinarily,

00:06:10.627 --> 00:06:12.963
| could take it down in one punch.

00:06:13.046 --> 00:06:15.048
Ah! Oh, no!

00:06:15.132 --> 00:06:16.675
What is it?

00:06:16.758 --> 00:06:20.178
"Strength enhancement function
restricted due to mating season."”

00:06:20.262 --> 00:06:23.724
It's recognized that I'm in my mating season!

00:06:23.807 --> 00:06:24.766
What do you mean?

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.228
When I'm in heat,
| can't make normal judgments,

00:06:28.312 --> 00:06:30.856
so my power suit's functions become restricted!

00:06:30.939 --> 00:06:32.566
You mean...

00:06:32.649 --> 00:06:36.570
Yes. I can't even call Luros or my Assistroids.

00:06:37.613 --> 00:06:39.698
In that case, you needn't worry.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.534
Making use of Earth's technology,

00:06:42.618 --> 00:06:45.662
we have prepared something
identical to your Assistroids for you.

00:06:45.746 --> 00:06:47.539
Please see for yourself.

00:06:55.505 --> 00:06:57.633
His name is Unya.

00:06:57.716 --> 00:07:00.135
Please allow him to serve at your side.

00:07:04.473 --> 00:07:06.099
Is this a guy in a suit?

00:07:06.183 --> 00:07:08.143
No! It is a robot.

00:07:08.226 --> 00:07:10.145
There is nobody inside it.

00:07:11.146 --> 00:07:14.816
We're going to rescue
Kakazu and Eris before the Androala

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.235
rendezvous with
the escort fleet standing by

00:07:17.319 --> 00:07:19.321
in the exclusive economic zone.

00:07:19.404 --> 00:07:20.489
All right.

00:07:20.572 --> 00:07:23.116
We'll secretly replace
the prop guns on the powerboat

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.952
with the real ones.

00:07:25.035 --> 00:07:27.329
That's fine, but are you
sure he'll accept the terms

00:07:27.412 --> 00:07:29.164
for borrowing the powerboat?

00:07:29.247 --> 00:07:32.793
Of course not. But once
we're out at sea, he can't stop us.

00:07:32.876 --> 00:07:34.920
| hate doing this to Uncle Yuichi,

00:07:35.003 --> 00:07:37.255
but we're going to
have to abuse him as our friend.

00:07:37.339 --> 00:07:39.591
We don't have time to take it slow.

00:07:39.675 --> 00:07:42.636
Ladies, we're almost at our destination.

00:07:48.809 --> 00:07:51.228
"--Ogasawara Archipelago Over Chichijima--"

00:07:51.812 --> 00:07:53.397
Good luck!

00:08:05.951 --> 00:08:08.870
Wow, amazing!

00:08:08.954 --> 00:08:11.957
You'd never think we were on a boat.

00:08:12.666 --> 00:08:13.208
"It has everything!"

00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:14.668
"It has everything!"
It has everything?

00:08:14.668 --> 00:08:15.293
It has everything?

00:08:15.377 --> 00:08:17.421
Oh, where are we going?

00:08:18.213 --> 00:08:20.173
A merry-go-round?

00:08:22.592 --> 00:08:27.055
Oh, this is a primitive
horse-riding simulator, right?

00:08:28.473 --> 00:08:33.145
It's so elaborately decorated,
I wonder if it belonged to royalty.

00:08:33.228 --> 00:08:35.981
The light of the filament-based bulb illumination

00:08:36.064 --> 00:08:38.316
is so warm and pretty!

00:08:45.365 --> 00:08:47.826
She sure seems to be enjoying herself.

00:08:48.952 --> 00:08:52.664
Hey, yeah. Later, we'll have to
all play each other at this.

00:08:52.748 --> 00:08:54.124
Huh?

00:08:54.791 --> 00:08:57.044
Are these all single-player?

00:08:59.296 --> 00:09:04.342
Isn't the guy in the
suit going to play against us?

00:09:04.426 --> 00:09:09.014
There is nobody inside.
That is a robot that we constructed,

00:09:09.097 --> 00:09:11.183
and there is no one inside it.

00:09:11.266 --> 00:09:17.105
O-Oh... Then, doesn't the
Founder here play games against anyone?

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:19.357
Games have winners and losers.

00:09:19.441 --> 00:09:22.819
We cannot very well beat our own Founder,

00:09:22.903 --> 00:09:26.239
and it would be rude
to hold back just to let her win.

00:09:27.407 --> 00:09:29.576
So what kind of person is this Founder?

00:09:29.659 --> 00:09:31.870
One who has obtained everything.

00:09:31.953 --> 00:09:33.205
Everything?

00:09:33.288 --> 00:09:36.208
She inherited the vast wealth
of her multimillionaire grandfather,

00:09:36.291 --> 00:09:39.294
and expending her ever-increasing
estate is her one and only job,

00:09:39.377 --> 00:09:41.004
if you can call it that.

00:09:41.088 --> 00:09:43.840
She is still a young lady, whose future is long,

00:09:43.924 --> 00:09:47.385
and whose flames of passion
have not yet begun to burn.

00:09:47.469 --> 00:09:50.931
And the first object that she
found to direct her passion toward

00:09:51.014 --> 00:09:52.933
was kitty-ears.

00:10:06.488 --> 00:10:08.281
I'm done over here.

00:10:08.824 --> 00:10:11.952
Same here. All we had to do was
swap out dummies for the real thing,

00:10:12.035 --> 00:10:13.870
so it was pretty easy, huh?

00:10:13.954 --> 00:10:17.666
The Androala is scheduled
to pass by here pretty soon.

00:10:17.749 --> 00:10:20.919
Let's set off before the
powerboat's owner shows up.

00:10:21.002 --> 00:10:22.170
Say, Aoi...

00:10:22.254 --> 00:10:23.338
What?

00:10:23.421 --> 00:10:25.715
Aoi, what is it about Kio that you like?

00:10:26.883 --> 00:10:28.760
Th-This is out of the blue...

00:10:28.844 --> 00:10:30.971
Oh come on, tell me.

00:10:31.054 --> 00:10:36.226
K-Kakazu is, you know, kind,
and cheerful, and he's a man of action.

00:10:36.309 --> 00:10:38.270
He's the complete opposite of me.

00:10:38.353 --> 00:10:40.689
But then, that's why, um...

00:10:41.898 --> 00:10:45.944
Manami, do you really
have no feelings for Kakazu?

00:10:46.027 --> 00:10:50.699
Why would 1?
That's a laugh. Of course I don't.

00:10:50.782 --> 00:10:53.076
Mm-mm, it's nothing.

00:10:54.327 --> 00:10:55.495
Oh.

00:10:56.621 --> 00:10:57.289
"We have a visitor"

00:10:57.664 --> 00:10:59.040
Visitor?

00:11:00.417 --> 00:11:02.294
Dear me...!

00:11:03.628 --> 00:11:06.548
Oh my, you certainly do
have your character down pat.

00:11:06.631 --> 00:11:09.467
| should have known Yuichums
would find the right girls.

00:11:09.551 --> 00:11:12.095
Yuichums? Then you're...

00:11:12.179 --> 00:11:15.640
That's right. I'm Kawasaki, the director,

00:11:15.724 --> 00:11:17.976
and this powerboat's owner.

00:11:18.059 --> 00:11:19.978
Oh, no! We're too late!

00:11:20.061 --> 00:11:22.898
Kawasaki, the director?
You mean that Kawasaki?

00:11:22.981 --> 00:11:24.900
Aoi, you know him?

00:11:24.983 --> 00:11:27.652
Mr. Kawasaki is a director who has produced

00:11:27.736 --> 00:11:30.280
a huge number of B-grade
action movies that all star women,

00:11:30.363 --> 00:11:33.742
and is a well-known figure
among a certain genre of fan.

00:11:33.825 --> 00:11:35.994
Okay, hurry up and get changed.

00:11:36.077 --> 00:11:38.705
Get changed? You don't mean...

00:11:38.788 --> 00:11:41.583
You are committed to
appearing in my movie, right?

00:11:41.666 --> 00:11:44.419
Our morning location
shoot is coming up quickly.

00:11:50.675 --> 00:11:52.636
--Cat Planet Cuties.
--Cat Planet Cuties.

00:12:01.603 --> 00:12:03.855
This shot will be from below, to pique the viewer.

00:12:03.939 --> 00:12:06.316
To tease and pique them, you see?

00:12:08.026 --> 00:12:09.527
What do we do, Aoi?

00:12:09.611 --> 00:12:11.947
W-We have no choice but to go on.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:15.742
What are you two doing?
The sun is already up.

00:12:15.825 --> 00:12:17.118
Aw, geez...

00:12:17.202 --> 00:12:18.995
Oh, my!

00:12:19.621 --> 00:12:21.164
Great!

00:12:21.248 --> 00:12:23.708
Beautiful! Let's start shooting right away!

00:12:23.792 --> 00:12:24.084
--We'll start with the beach scene. Get ready!

00:12:24.084 --> 00:12:24.876
--Manami!
--We'll start with the beach scene. Get ready!

00:12:24.876 --> 00:12:26.544
--Okay.
--We'll start with the beach scene. Get ready!

00:12:27.629 --> 00:12:30.465
Hey, you two! We're not doing that yet!

00:12:36.471 --> 00:12:38.265
Hey, you!

00:12:49.484 --> 00:12:53.154
Schedule change!
We'll start shooting from the battle scene!

00:12:57.951 --> 00:12:59.911
You're worn out from playing, huh?

00:12:59.995 --> 00:13:02.205
You must have had a lot of fun.

00:13:02.289 --> 00:13:07.794
Ah, it's been so long since
I've seen her resting so peacefully.

00:13:07.877 --> 00:13:10.130
| thought he was a robot.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:12.632
--What is it?

00:13:12.632 --> 00:13:14.050
--Message from the radar room.
--What is it?

00:13:14.134 --> 00:13:16.594
There is a small watercraft
approaching the ship at high speed

00:13:16.678 --> 00:13:18.471
from Chichijima Island.

00:13:31.318 --> 00:13:32.902
| see it!

00:13:38.992 --> 00:13:40.160
There they are!

00:13:40.243 --> 00:13:44.122
Nice! Very nice!

00:13:44.205 --> 00:13:45.332
Status report.

00:13:45.415 --> 00:13:47.292
This boat has entered our field of view,

00:13:47.375 --> 00:13:50.211
but isn't this a bit much
for just one vessel, Miss Maya?

00:13:50.295 --> 00:13:52.213
Even if Charmed Momiji is aboard?

00:13:52.297 --> 00:13:54.632
It couldn't be.
She fell from the train in Tokyo,

00:13:54.716 --> 00:13:56.509
and should have been badly injured.

00:13:56.593 --> 00:13:58.428
If she were an ordinary human, maybe.

00:13:58.511 --> 00:14:01.222
But take her too lightly,
and there'll be hell to pay.

00:14:01.306 --> 00:14:03.308
Take fire control.

00:14:03.391 --> 00:14:04.768
Roger!

00:14:09.397 --> 00:14:10.565
Fire!

00:14:15.653 --> 00:14:16.446
Now!

00:14:16.529 --> 00:14:17.697
Okay!

00:14:27.499 --> 00:14:30.543
It can't be! Our targeting is off!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.546
They're cracking us!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:37.384
Someone has forced their
way into our firing control systems!

00:14:37.467 --> 00:14:38.093
What was that?

00:14:38.134 --> 00:14:39.844
| don't know. We've been hit.

00:14:39.928 --> 00:14:41.429
Radar, what do you see?

00:14:41.513 --> 00:14:43.473
| didn't pick up anything!

00:14:48.478 --> 00:14:50.355
What happened to those missiles?

00:14:50.438 --> 00:14:52.065
They're our latest weapon.

00:14:52.148 --> 00:14:55.777
They're absolutely top secret,
so mention them to no one.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.445
Let's move to finish them off!

00:14:57.529 --> 00:14:59.114
Prepare for battle!

00:15:01.032 --> 00:15:03.576
It turns out that having
everything is no different

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.995
than having nothing at all.

00:15:11.251 --> 00:15:15.588
The bullets in Yun-fat's
toy guns are quasi-antimatter.

00:15:15.672 --> 00:15:18.842
They are able to obliterate any non-living matter

00:15:18.925 --> 00:15:21.344
by means of quasi-annihilation.

00:15:26.349 --> 00:15:27.934
Here we go!

00:15:32.814 --> 00:15:35.817
I'll cause disruptions,
and lure the enemy away.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.361
I'll search for Kio and Eris, and rescue them.

00:15:38.445 --> 00:15:40.947
There is a breach in the hull,
and we're taking on water!

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:43.366
Location: C76 and C77!

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.785
It's not where the missiles hit us?

00:15:45.869 --> 00:15:47.787
There's a boarding craft inside the ship!

00:15:47.871 --> 00:15:50.123
Intruders! Take defensive positions!

00:15:51.124 --> 00:15:52.959
I'm heading there, too.

00:15:54.878 --> 00:15:56.254
This is amazing!

00:15:56.337 --> 00:15:57.630
Nicely done.

00:15:57.714 --> 00:16:00.258
It doesn't detect that
I'm in heat, so when I wear it,

00:16:00.341 --> 00:16:02.469
the functionality restrictions are lifted.

00:16:02.552 --> 00:16:05.805
Okay then, please contact my Assistroids.

00:16:05.889 --> 00:16:07.056
Mm-hmm.

00:16:12.562 --> 00:16:13.938
After her!

00:16:17.817 --> 00:16:19.611
Over there!

00:16:25.074 --> 00:16:26.034
What?!

00:16:27.827 --> 00:16:30.079
Time to pay your boarding fee!

00:16:30.705 --> 00:16:32.040
"Hallo"

00:16:32.207 --> 00:16:35.919
Executive Officer Sara is a
sucker for cute things and cats.

00:16:36.002 --> 00:16:38.796
As a result of this tendency,
she left behind a career

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:43.009
as an up-and-coming SAS elite,
and ended up where she is now.

00:16:44.302 --> 00:16:46.095
How cute!

00:16:59.526 --> 00:17:02.779
That should shut down
the power before too long.

00:17:08.368 --> 00:17:09.953
She looks just...

00:17:10.036 --> 00:17:10.954
...like me...

00:17:11.037 --> 00:17:14.457
I'd always heard that
Japan was a nation of monkeys,

00:17:14.541 --> 00:17:17.502
and sure enough, you handle
monkey-see, monkey-do quite well!

00:17:18.753 --> 00:17:20.338
Why, you...!

00:17:23.132 --> 00:17:24.592
| can't move!

00:17:24.676 --> 00:17:26.219
Aw, too bad.

00:17:26.302 --> 00:17:28.304
Things built with canine
technology are designed

00:17:28.388 --> 00:17:31.140
so that they cannot attack dogs.

00:17:32.308 --> 00:17:34.435
Farewell, Charmed Momiji!

00:17:34.519 --> 00:17:35.895
Apport!

00:17:39.065 --> 00:17:42.235
Hmph, did you think it would work
as long as you didn't attack me?

00:17:42.318 --> 00:17:43.486
Wishful thinking!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:45.029
Not exactly.

00:17:45.113 --> 00:17:46.197
What?

00:17:46.281 --> 00:17:48.700
My suit has the same drawback.

00:17:48.783 --> 00:17:51.494
The hard-soft powered suit is flexible armor.

00:17:51.578 --> 00:17:54.831
But once the controls shut down,
it's a human-shaped coffin.

00:17:57.041 --> 00:17:58.668
You impudent little monkey!

00:17:58.751 --> 00:17:59.627
Doggie-ears?

00:17:59.711 --> 00:18:01.504
I'll kill you!

00:18:15.518 --> 00:18:21.190
Dog Leader to War Dog,
blast my current position in thirty seconds.

00:18:28.698 --> 00:18:30.366
All hands, prepare to abandon ship.

00:18:30.366 --> 00:18:30.450
"Fighting is always in vain"
All hands, prepare to abandon ship.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:30.617
"Fighting is always in vain" "Vanquish all
demons" All hands, prepare to abandon ship.

00:18:30.617 --> 00:18:30.700
"Fighting is always in vain" "Vanquish
all demons" "This is a dream; all a dream"

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.869
<i>"Fighting is always in vain" "Vanquish all demons" "This is
a dream; all a dream" All hands, prepare to abandon ship.</i>

00:18:32.869 --> 00:18:33.244
All hands, prepare to abandon ship.

00:18:33.328 --> 00:18:35.788
My lady, we must get ready to leave.

00:18:35.872 --> 00:18:37.165
Are we sinking?

00:18:37.248 --> 00:18:38.750
I'm terribly sorry.

00:18:38.833 --> 00:18:39.917
Manami!

00:18:40.001 --> 00:18:42.086
Kio! Thank goodness!

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:44.172
But what's with the outfit?

00:18:44.255 --> 00:18:48.509
M-Manami, what about you and that outfit?

00:18:48.593 --> 00:18:53.097
Oh, Manami,
are you a Rabbitian bunny-eared alien?

00:18:53.181 --> 00:18:56.267
Of course not! Anyway, let's get going!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:59.729
You're the ones!
How dare you attack this ship!

00:18:59.812 --> 00:19:01.606
Says you, you kidnapper!

00:19:01.689 --> 00:19:03.483
Turn the Divine Embodiment over to us!

00:19:03.566 --> 00:19:05.818
You know there's no way we're doing that!

00:19:05.902 --> 00:19:08.321
There's no time. If you resist, I'll shoot you.

00:19:08.404 --> 00:19:09.614
That's my line!

00:19:09.697 --> 00:19:13.242
Stop it! This is no time to be doing this!

00:19:13.326 --> 00:19:14.869
Stay out of this! Though you may

00:19:14.952 --> 00:19:17.205
be the Divine Embodiment's
tagalong, you'll get no mercy!

00:19:17.288 --> 00:19:19.874
No matter how badly
you want something you can't have,

00:19:19.957 --> 00:19:21.501
does it please you to just take it?

00:19:21.584 --> 00:19:24.087
There is nothing that the lady cannot have.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:27.215
Yet she doesn't have any friends, does she?

00:19:27.298 --> 00:19:29.592
She has many loyal servants waiting on her.

00:19:29.676 --> 00:19:32.470
No, no! Someone you
can cry with, and laugh with,

00:19:32.553 --> 00:19:36.391
get mad at and argue with,
then make up again with is a friend!

00:19:36.474 --> 00:19:38.935
Those who follow you and
submit to you are not friends!

00:19:39.018 --> 00:19:40.645
Don't give me that!

00:19:40.728 --> 00:19:44.440
After all, it's weird when there's
no one who can play a game with you.

00:19:45.733 --> 00:19:47.151
Why, you...

00:19:47.235 --> 00:19:48.653
That's enough, Maya.

00:19:48.736 --> 00:19:50.446
My lady...

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:53.783
What we've done to Lady Eris
and Mister Kakazu is wrong.

00:19:53.866 --> 00:19:56.494
| was mistaken, and I apologize.

00:19:56.577 --> 00:19:57.870
My lady...!

00:19:57.954 --> 00:20:01.666
We are abandoning ship in a lifeboat.
You may come with us!

00:20:01.749 --> 00:20:04.502
Thank you very much, Unya.

00:20:04.585 --> 00:20:08.005
I-I am not the person who was inside Unya...

00:20:08.089 --> 00:20:09.841
Thank you very much.

00:20:10.883 --> 00:20:11.676
Sure...

00:20:11.718 --> 00:20:14.637
Oh, no! I'm not reading Aoi!

00:20:14.721 --> 00:20:14.762
"Sha's unconscious in the engine room"

00:20:14.762 --> 00:20:16.556
"Sha's unconscious in the engine room"
She's unconscious in the engine room?!

00:20:16.556 --> 00:20:16.764
She's unconscious in the engine room?!

00:20:16.848 --> 00:20:17.849
What happened?

00:20:17.932 --> 00:20:21.853
Assistroids are able to
monitor their master's vital signs.

00:20:21.936 --> 00:20:23.771
Oh, no! What do we do?

00:20:23.855 --> 00:20:27.275
The engine room is far away.
There's no time to go save her.

00:20:28.818 --> 00:20:30.403
The huge ship is sinking!

00:20:30.486 --> 00:20:32.363
Roll all cameras!

00:20:32.447 --> 00:20:34.699
Make sure you get this!

00:20:36.784 --> 00:20:37.869
Next time,

00:20:37.952 --> 00:20:39.912
I'll crush the life out of you.

00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:45.251
Futaba!

00:20:46.377 --> 00:20:47.754
Futaba!

00:20:48.838 --> 00:20:50.298
Futaba!

00:20:51.132 --> 00:20:53.050
Kakazu...

00:21:12.028 --> 00:21:14.697
Me... being saved by Kakazu...?

00:21:15.865 --> 00:21:17.658
Am I dreaming?

00:21:50.483 --> 00:21:53.444
If I'm dreaming, then I can say it...

00:22:00.743 --> 00:22:03.996
...love you...

00:22:07.333 --> 00:22:12.088
| called forth the inevitable

00:22:12.171 --> 00:22:17.093
to guide me toward your light

00:22:17.176 --> 00:22:21.389
In the unyielding rain of my heartbeat

00:22:21.472 --> 00:22:26.352
I'm here all by myself

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:32.275
just searching for an unending dream,

00:22:32.358 --> 00:22:37.446
passing through the moment

00:22:38.531 --> 00:22:43.369
If there is a tomorrow

00:22:43.452 --> 00:22:48.583
that knows the breadth of the sky

00:22:48.666 --> 00:22:53.880
then I will blaze my way through any darkness

00:22:53.963 --> 00:22:58.259
here at the windowsill of my heart

00:22:58.342 --> 00:23:03.180
My wishes swimming through

00:23:03.264 --> 00:23:08.436
the waves of my sighs

00:23:08.519 --> 00:23:14.191
chase after the miracle that spells out

00:23:14.275 --> 00:23:21.741
a story that no one knows

00:23:29.248 --> 00:23:32.668
Rolled eggs and fried prawns,
the handmade lunch of a girl dreamer!

00:23:32.752 --> 00:23:34.253
If Love's pistol finds its mark,

00:23:34.337 --> 00:23:36.881
she'll catch his heart with her girlish charm!

00:23:36.964 --> 00:23:40.134
Next time, "I've Practiced.”

00:23:40.217 --> 00:23:42.595
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:47.391 --> 00:23:48.434
"See you next time!"
